      "items": [
        "Questions frequently test memory hierarchy speed order: Registers > Cache > RAM > Secondary Storage.",
        "Remember key conversions: 1 Byte = 8 Bits, 1 Nibble = 4 Bits, and 1 KB = 1024 Bytes.",
        "Distinguish volatile memory (RAM) from non-volatile memory (ROM, HDD, SSD, Flash Memory) for classification questions."
